All independent controls are now reproducible from a relocatable `--inputs` path. The complete-map checker matched 2,088 map records (238 fixed), all six contracts, 660/120 index accounting, 324 finite-power lift cases, and 24 derivative cases in both modes; no production-sized polynomial was formed. The exact frozen 53-check suite also passed in both modes from fresh owned paths, without invoking its collision-prone runner.
